</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Before our Father’s throne,</l><l>We pour our ardent prayers;</l><l>Our fears, our hopes, our aims are one—</l><l>Our comforts and our cares.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>We share our mutual woes;</l><l>Our mutual burdens bear;</l><l>And often for each other flows</l><l>The sympathizing tear.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>When we asunder part,</l><l>It gives us inward pain;</l><l>But we shall still be joined in heart,</l><l>And hope to meet again.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>From sorrow, toil, and pain,</l><l>And sin we shall be free;</l><l>And perfect love and oneness reign</l><l>Through all eternity.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
